<span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I don’t have a built-in count of individuals by gender. However, in the publicly available sources I draw from [..]. So [..] I would “know” more males than females. <math id="S1.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">false</span></span>
