<span id="S1.T1.2.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I likely “know” more about Chinese entities than Canadian ones, simply because China [..] more [..] documented. <math id="S1.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S1.T1.2.1.10.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">false</span></span>
